# Firebase service-account key files (downloaded from the Firebase console) —
# these are plaintext private keys granting full Admin SDK access and must
# never be committed. The app reads the credential from the
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON env var instead of a file on disk.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*-adminsdk-*.json
